<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Powerscreen yr pretax profit 42.4 mln pounds.</title>
<headline>Powerscreen yr pretax profit 42.4 mln pounds.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31</p>
<p>			    (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		36.1		   vs 30.5</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  7.4		   vs 6.7</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    42.4		   vs 36.04</p>
<p> Turnover		   305.0		  vs 261.31</p>
<p>NOTE - Northern Ireland-based engineering firm Powerscreen International said it expects the current year to follow last year's trends. It said it believes it will have a strong year in North America while Europe will prove the hardest challenge.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353-1-661-3377</p>
